{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Drop Dash (DDD) is a fast-paced, memory-based mission game that puts your navigation skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a near-future world where drone delivery is a core part of daily logistics, players must memorize flight paths, avoid no-fly zones, and complete high-precision missions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real-world drone challenges such as restricted airspace, collision risks, and strict route planning, DDD delivers a focused gameplay loop built on accuracy, timing, and mental recall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through increasingly complex levels, complete deliveries with efficiency, and avoid costly mistakes. Your goal:\u2028Rise through the ranks and become a top-tier drone pilot.\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features\u2028\u2022 Memory-based navigation gameplay\u2028\u2022 Route optimization and obstacle avoidance\u2028\u2022 Simple controls, escalating difficulty\u2028\u2022 Short, skill-focused mission structure\u2028\u2022 Clean visuals and tight pacing\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Drop Dash captures the thrill of precision flight and the tension of real-world delivery scenarios\u2014all in a compact, strategic arcade-style experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776910?t=1753083719","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776910?t=1753083719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776910/720f4f3bd0fab3e83ae92d1aadfc424658174d66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753083719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776910/720f4f3bd0fab3e83ae92d1aadfc424658174d66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753083719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Drop Dash (DDD) is a fast-paced, memory-based mission game that puts your navigation skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a near-future world where drone delivery is a core part of daily logistics, players must memorize flight paths, avoid no-fly zones, and complete high-precision missions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real-world drone challenges such as restricted airspace, collision risks, and strict route planning, DDD delivers a focused gameplay loop built on accuracy, timing, and mental recall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through increasingly complex levels, complete deliveries with efficiency, and avoid costly mistakes. Your goal:\u2028Rise through the ranks and become a top-tier drone pilot.\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features\u2028\u2022 Memory-based navigation gameplay\u2028\u2022 Route optimization and obstacle avoidance\u2028\u2022 Simple controls, escalating difficulty\u2028\u2022 Short, skill-focused mission structure\u2028\u2022 Clean visuals and tight pacing\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Drop Dash captures the thrill of precision flight and the tension of real-world delivery scenarios\u2014all in a compact, strategic arcade-style experience.</p>","developers":["Yosul Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776910/100eeeb9a56075328ad53c3f93fe0affaf3bda8a/header.jpg?t=1753083719","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas